      "id": "ipamorelin",
      "name": "Ipamorelin",
      "aliases": [],
      "kind": "product",
      "identityStatus": "needs_confirmation",
      "categoryID": 4,
      "benefits": "Demonstrated biological effect: transient growth hormone release during a small human volunteer pharmacology study. This is a biomarker response, without demonstrated gains in muscle, recovery, sleep, fat loss, or longevity. A randomized postoperative-ileus trial did not show a statistically significant improvement in its principal meal-tolerance endpoint. Those IV studies also do not establish clinical benefits of the subcutaneous wellness regimens or ipamorelin-containing stacks in this library."
    }
  ],
