              "section": "Who Ipamorelin Is For and Who Should Avoid It",
              "subsection": "Avoid use in",
              "excerpt": "Active or recent cancer. GH and IGF-1 can support cell growth. Anyone with current or recent cancer should avoid GH-raising compounds.",
              "truncated": false
            },
            {
              "section": "Who Ipamorelin Is For and Who Should Avoid It",
              "subsection": "Avoid use in",
              "excerpt": "Pregnancy or breastfeeding. There is no safety data for ipamorelin in either group.",
              "truncated": false
            },
